:js

// Regression test: `if true` with `then` on a new indented line should work
// the same as `if true then` on the same line.

// Works (same line)
if true then
    5
  else 1
//│ = 5

// Previously broken (then on next line)
if true
  then
    5
  else 1
//│ = 5

// Also test false
if false
  then
    5
  else 1
//│ = 1

